second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What sport is Boca Juniors associated with?\", \"slot_hint\": \"sport\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 131, \"text\": \"Boca Juniors (basketball) Boca Juniors basketball section is part of the Boca Juniors sports club based in Buenos Aires, Argentina.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d00\", \"start\": 132, \"end\": 236, \"text\": \"The team plays in the Liga Nacional de Básquet (LNB), the first division of the Argentine league system.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d00\", \"start\": 237, \"end\": 430, \"text\": \"Boca's home games are played at the Estadio Luis Conde, also called the \\\"Bombonerita\\\" (in English: \\\"Small Bombonera\\\"), as a reference to the club's football stadium known as the \\\"La Bombonera\\\".\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d00\", \"start\": 431, \"end\": 616, \"text\": \"Boca was one of the most successful teams before the creation of the LNB, winning a large amount of titles such as the Torneo Oficial, Torneo Apertura and Torneo Metropolitano organized\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 185, \"text\": \"Boca Juniors de Cali Boca Juniors de Cali was a professional football team which represented the city of Cali since its creation in 1949 until its exit from professional soccer in 1957.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d01\", \"start\": 186, \"end\": 267, \"text\": \"Since its early years it adopted the jersey from the Argentine team Boca Juniors.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d01\", \"start\": 268, \"end\": 336, \"text\": \"Nowadays, the team participates in the amateur football of Colombia.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d01\", \"start\": 337, \"end\": 406, \"text\": \"Boca Juniors de Cali was one of the most important teams of its time.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d01\", \"start\": 407, \"end\": 529, \"text\": \"It had been in second place at the end of the 1951 and 1952 seasons, finishing behind Millonarios of Bogotá in both cases.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d01\", \"start\": 530, \"end\": 561, \"text\": \"It was also the champion of the\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Boca Juniors\", \"scope\": \"sports club section\", \"claim\": \"Boca Juniors basketball section is part of the Boca Juniors sports club based in Buenos Aires, Argentina.\", \"answer\": \"basketball\", \"quote\": \"Boca Juniors (basketball) Boca Juniors basketball section is part of the Boca Juniors sports club based in Buenos Aires, Argentina.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0195-878814c18a82:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Boca Juniors de Cali\", \"scope\": \"professional and amateur team\", \"claim\": \"Boca Juniors de Cali was a professional football team which represented the city of Cali since its creation in 1949 until its exit from professional soccer in 1957.\", \"answer\": \"football\", \"quote\": \"Boca Juniors de Cali Boca Juniors de Cali was a professional football team which represented the city of Cali since its creation in 1949 until its exit from professional soccer in 1957. Since its early years it adopted the jersey from the Argentine team Boca Juniors. Nowadays, the team p